#===============================================================================
#  ARDHANARISHVARA OS — ENGINEERING SUPPORT DOCUMENT
#  App Runtime Engine
#  File: app_runtime_engine.support
#===============================================================================
#  PURPOSE:
#    Engineering reference for the SovereignOS application runtime engine
#    responsible for:
#      • app lifecycle execution
#      • async runtime sandbox
#      • IPC messaging
#      • app state persistence
#
#===============================================================================
#  MODULE SUMMARY:
#
#    - [App Execution](ca://s?q=Explain_App_Execution)
#    - [Runtime Sandbox](ca://s?q=Explain_Runtime_Sandbox)
#    - [IPC Messaging](ca://s?q=Explain_IPC_Messaging)
#    - [App State](ca://s?q=Explain_App_State)
#
#===============================================================================
#  FUNCTION OVERVIEW:
#
#    - register_executor(app_id, executor)
#         Registers an app's execution handler.
#
#    - start(app_id, payload)
#         Starts an app asynchronously.
#
#    - stop(app_id)
#         Stops an app.
#
#    - set_state(app_id, key, value)
#         Stores app state.
#
#    - get_state(app_id, key)
#         Retrieves app state.
#
#    - register_ipc(channel, handler)
#         Registers IPC channel.
#
#    - ipc(channel, payload)
#         Sends IPC message.
#
#    - snapshot()
#         Returns full runtime state.
#
#===============================================================================
#  APP STRUCTURE FORMAT:
#
#    {
#      "executor": <callable>,
#      "state": { ... },
#      "running": true/false,
#      "last_run": <epoch>
#    }
#
#===============================================================================
#  RELATED MODULES:
#
